<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF says plans to auction T-bills on Wed.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF says plans to auction T-bills on Wed.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance (MOF) plans to hold an auction of Treasury bills on Wednesday, a MOF official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The offer is likely to be 1.4 trillion yen worth of six-month T-bills, bond traders said.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-9780</p>
</text>
